                        <h1 class="pl-3 pr-3 col-12">About HINTS</h1>
                        <p class="pl-3 pr-3">Since 2003, HINTS has collected nationally representative data related to health communication and information technology. On this page, you can learn more about HINTS, find answers to frequently asked questions, and receive the latest HINTS news.</p>
                        <div class="card-deck mb-4 mr-0 ml-0">
                            <div class="card">
                                <div class="card-body p-4">
                                    <h5 class="card-title">About HINTS</h5>
                                    <p class="card-text">Learn more about the HINTS program, who sponsors HINTS, and how HINTS data can be used in research and practice.</p>
                                    <p class="card-text"><a href="/about-hints/learn-more-about-hints.aspx">Read More</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card">
                                <div class="card-body p-4">
                                    <h5 class="card-title">What Makes HINTS Unique</h5>
                                    <p class="card-text">Find out how HINTS, the only nationally representative, federally funded survey with a focus on the communication environment and use of information technology, is used to study key topics related to health communication.</p>
                                    <p class="card-text"><a href="/about-hints/hints-unique.aspx">Read More</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card">
                                <div class="card-body p-4">
                                    <h5 class="card-title">Announcements</h5>
                                    <p class="card-text">Stay informed about the latest HINTS news, including the release of new datasets and other resources. <br /> You can also <a href="/subscribe/default.aspx" target="_blank">subscribe</a> to our listserv to receive HINTS updates.</p>
                                    <p class="card-text"><a href="/about-hints/announcements.aspx">Read More</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card">
                                <div class="card-body p-4">
                                    <h5 class="card-title">FAQs</h5>
                                    <p class="card-text">Find answers to questions about HINTS data collection procedures, using HINTS items in your own work, and analyzing HINTS data (including testing for mode effects and examining trends over time), among other topics.</p>
                                    <p class="card-text"><a href="/about-hints/frequently-asked-questions.aspx">Read More</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card">
                                <div class="card-body p-4">
                                    <h5 class="card-title">Instrument Development and Validation</h5>
                                    <p class="card-text">Find information about HINTS survey instrument development and validation, including details about cognitive testing of items that appear on HINTS surveys.</p>
                                    <p class="card-text"><a href="/about-hints/instrument-development.aspx">Read More</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card">
                                <div class="card-body p-4">
                                    <h5 class="card-title">Institutional Review Board (IRB) Determinations  </h5>
                                    <p class="card-text">Access information on Institutional Review Board (IRB) approvals for HINTS surveys.</p>
                                    <p class="card-text"><a href="/about-hints/institutional-review-board.aspx">Read More</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card">
                                <div class="card-body p-4">
                                    <h5 class="card-title">Were You Selected to Participate in a HINTS Survey?</h5>
                                    <p class="card-text">Learn more about the survey, how your privacy is protected, and why your participation is so important.</p>
                                    <p class="card-text"><a href="/about-hints/contacted-by-hints.aspx">Read More</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <%--<div class="card">
                                <div class="card-body p-4">
